@* [REQ-UI-078] The logo: the white Chatur glyph on a 20 px amber square (mockups/start.html `.logo`).
   The amber square is part of the drawing, so it holds in every theme without a stylesheet rule; the
   element carries the same amber as its background, as the mockup's `.logo` does, so it reads amber too. *@
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none" style="background:#B45F14;border-radius:5px" role="img" aria-label="Chatur" data-testid="logo">
    <rect width="1024" height="1024" rx="256" fill="#B45F14" data-testid="logo-square" />
    <g data-testid="logo-glyph" fill="#FFFFFF">
        <rect x="322" y="187" width="380" height="72" />
        <rect x="322" y="187" width="72" height="560" />
        <rect x="322" y="675" width="380" height="72" />
        <rect x="630" y="187" width="72" height="122" />
        <rect x="630" y="625" width="72" height="122" />
        <polygon points="484,347 541.6,347 661.6,467 541.6,587 484,587 604,467" />
        <polygon points="394,747 504,747 394,837" />
    </g>
</svg>
